      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me draft a quick memo to our remote employees? I want to remind them about ergonomic workstation setups—stuff like chair height, monitor positioning, and taking breaks—so they don't end up with wrist or back pain. Just keep it professional and helpful.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a sample memo you can use:\n\nDear Remote Team,\n\nAs we continue to work from home, let's prioritize our well-being by maintaining proper ergonomic workstation setups. This includes adjusting your chair height to ensure your feet are flat on the floor or on a footrest, positioning your monitor directly in front of you at a comfortable distance, and taking regular breaks to stretch and move around. By taking a few simple steps, you can reduce the risk of developing wrist or back pain and stay comfortable throughout the workday. If you have any questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to reach out.\n\nBest regards, [Your Name]",
